@refreshCookie = refreshToken==eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwiZW1haWwiOiJ0ZXN0MUBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInR5cGUiOiJyZWZyZXNoIiwiaWF0IjoxNzY5NTgyNTc2LCJleHAiOjE3Njk1ODMxODF9.YxV75txDY4aDpqW9tiYzCjpfboXouyGWJsqD8eF2BFnBkIDKB-B9gAcBjACZguih


# 로그인 -------------------------------------------

### 0-1. 일반 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "nickname": "{{nickname}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 0-2. 일반 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 0-3. Access Token 재발급
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: {{refreshCookie}}

### 0-4. 로그아웃
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/auth/logout
Cookie: {{refreshCookie}}


### 1-1. 전체 인기작 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies/popular?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 1-2. 인기 상영작 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies/now-playing?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

# 1-3. 영화 찾기 (필터링, 정렬 지원)
# keyword: 제목 검색 (2글자 이상, 선택)
# genreId: 장르 ID (선택, 전체는 생략)
# releaseYearFrom: 시작 연도 (선택)
# releaseYearTo: 종료 연도 (선택)
# sortBy: latest(최신순) 또는 rating(평점순), 기본값: latest

### 1-3. 0) 영화 찾기 (최신순)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?page=0&size=10&sortBy=latest
Accept: application/json

### 1-3. 1) 영화 찾기 (평점순)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?page=0&size=10&sortBy=rating
Accept: application/json

### 1-3. 2) 영화 찾기 (제목 검색: 아바타)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?page=0&size=10&keyword=아바타
Accept: application/json

### 1-3. 3) 영화 찾기 (장르 필터: 액션)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?page=0&size=10&genreId={{genreId}}
Accept: application/json

### 1-3. 4) 영화 찾기 (연도 범위: 2000~2011)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?page=0&size=10&releaseYearFrom=2000&releaseYearTo=2011
Accept: application/json

### 1-3. 5) 영화 찾기 (장르 + 연도 + 정렬 조합)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies?page=0&size=10&genreId={{genreId}}&releaseYearFrom=2020&releaseYearTo=2024&sortBy=rating
Accept: application/json


# 영화 -------------------------------------------


### 2-1. 영화 상세 (비로그인)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}?commentPage={{commentPage}}&commentSize={{commentSize}}
Accept: application/json

### 2-2. 영화 상세 댓글 다음 페이지(비로그인)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}?commentPage=1&commentSize={{commentSize}}
Accept: application/json

### 2-3. 영화 상세
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}?commentPage={{commentPage}}&commentSize={{commentSize}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}


# 장르 키워드 -------------------------------------------

### 3-1. 장르 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/genres
Accept: application/json

### 3-2. 키워드 전체 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/keywords
Accept: application/json


# 프로필, 컬렉션 -------------------------------------------

### 4-1. 내 프로필 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 4-2. 내 프로필 수정 (닉네임)
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "nickname": "새로운닉네임2"
}

### 4-3. 관심 장르 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/genres
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 4-4. 관심 장르 등록 (genreId = tmdbGenreId)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/genres
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "genreId": {{genreId}}
}

### 4-5. 관심 장르 삭제 (genreId = tmdbGenreId)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/genres/{{genreId}}
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 4-6. 관심 키워드 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/keywords
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 4-7. 관심 키워드 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/keywords
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "keywordName": "{{keywordName}}"
}

### 4-8. 관심 키워드 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/keywords
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "keywordName": "{{keywordName}}"
}

### 4-9. 내가 작성한 리뷰 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/reviews?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 4-10. 내가 본 영화 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/users/me/watched-movies?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}


# 왓치드무비 -------------------------------------------

### 5-1. 본 영화 등록/수정
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/watched-movies
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "tmdbId": {{tmdbId}},
  "score": 8
}

### 5-2. 본 영화 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/watched-movies?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 5-3. 본 영화 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/watched-movies/{{tmdbId}}
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}


# 무비레이팅 한줄평 -------------------------------------------

### 6-1. 평점/코멘트 등록/수정
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/ratings
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "tmdbId": {{tmdbId}},
  "score": 9,
  "comment": "정말 좋은 영화입니다!",
  "isRecommended": true
}

### 6-2. 평점/코멘트 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/ratings/{{tmdbId}}
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}


# 리뷰 게시판 -------------------------------------------

### 7-1. 리뷰 목록 조회 (sort: latest|popular|likes, keyword, tmdbId)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews?page=0&size=10&sort=latest
Accept: application/json

### 7-2. 리뷰 목록 조회 (인기순/좋아요순)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews?page=0&size=10&sort=popular
Accept: application/json

GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews?page=0&size=10&sort=likes
Accept: application/json

### 7-3. 리뷰 목록 조회 (키워드 필터)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews?page=0&size=10&keyword={{keywordName}}
Accept: application/json

### 7-4. 리뷰 목록 조회 (tmdbId 필터)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews?page=0&size=10&tmdbId={{tmdbId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7-5. 리뷰 작성
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "tmdbId": {{tmdbId}},
  "title": "리뷰 제목",
  "content": "리뷰 내용",
  "score": 9,
  "keywords": ["{{keywordName}}", "혼자", "힐링"]
}

### 7-6. 리뷰 상세 조회 (비로그인: 좋아요 여부는 사용자 기준 정보가 없을 수 있음)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7-7. 리뷰 상세 조회 (로그인)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 7-8. 리뷰 좋아요/취소 (토글)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}/like
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

### 7-9. 리뷰 수정
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}

{
  "title": "수정된 리뷰 제목",
  "content": "수정된 리뷰 내용",
  "score": 8,
  "keywords": ["{{keywordName}}", "슬픔"]
}

### 7-10. 리뷰 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Cookie: {{accessCookie}}
